==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[King Wahwah]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Oldstrich|Oldstriches]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is advisable to cheese this stage given its difficulty when taken on normally. You can accomplish this by bringing [[Sniper the Cat]] and using Starting Money UP [[Cat Combo]]s to get a head start on rushing. Use a [[:Category:Cats with Money Up ability|Cat with the Money Up ability]] to defeat the first [[Dogenstein]] and send out [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] as soon as you can to hopefully take down the enemy base just as King Wahwah and the first Oldstrich spawn.

Should this strategy fail or get patched out of the game, it is still recommended to play the start aggressively, fishing Money Up drops from Dogenstein and Mistress Celeboodle. [[Rich Cat]] and Sniper the Cat are recommended. Due to King Wahwah's Long Distance attacks, [[Cataur]] cannot be used as damage here. Your goal is to use bulkier attackers to take down the Oldstriches quickly while adding in snipers to keep King Wahwah away from the front as long as possible. Use [[Cat Cannon|Holy Blast]] to finish off each Oldstrich.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Eraser Cat]] - Though slow, its ability to [[Dodge]] [[Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] can help significantly when stalling Oldstrich.
*[[Shigong Cat]] - Another very bulky Zombie meatshield that can be used to stall Oldstrich.
*[[Fried Chicken Cat]] - Has high enough HP to withstand King Wahwah, and its [[Curse]] ability can help Shigong and your Eraser(s) stall effectively. In a pinch, it can also snipe a Zombie Kill on Oldstrich if you mess up the Holy Blast timing.
*[[Li'l King Dragon Cat]] - The main attacker for this stage. His bulk is very high for his cost and he is capable of being both the main damager against Oldstrich and a [[Mini-Wave]] sniper against Wahwah.
*[[Housewife Cat]] - Another main damager who can assist via Zombie Killer and the occasional Slow against Oldstrich, which can help in a pinch.
*[[Manic Macho Legs]] - Has a consistent [[Wave Attack]]. A sniper is important here to keep King Wahwah at bay so your damagers get more time alone against Oldstrich.
*[[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] - Though inconsistent throughout the fight, it is useful to get a good startoff and occasionally hits Dogensteins for a guaranteed knockback against Wahwah.
*[[Bullet Train Cat]] - Useful for sniping Dogensteins and Mistress Celeboodles for Money Up throughout the fight. Timed well, Bullet Train can usually land 2 hits against Oldstrich with the assistance of Wahwah's [[Knockback]] ability.
*[[Cyberpunk Cat]] - Cyberpunk can be used to both hold back Oldstrich from far range and keep Wahwah back after Oldstrich pushes in. The [[Survive]] Talent is recommended to gain a second chance to keep Wahwah away if he gets hit.
*[[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Catnova]] - Should you have Catnova, this stage becomes significantly easier thanks to her immense HP stat as defense against Wahwah and [[Sage Slayer]] ability, which allows her to [[Slow]] and occasionally Curse Oldstrich for longer than most other units. It is not recommended to use Housewife or Cyberpunk alongside Catnova as they can override her Slow effect.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie]] Nukers - These [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] help take down Oldstrich quickly, giving more time to push back Wahwah. Examples of these include [[B.C.S. Tigerclaw]], [[Ultra Atlantis Logistix]], [[CAT-10 Gigapult]], and [[Daybreaker Izanagi (Legend Rare Cat)|Dawnbringer Izanagi]].
*[[Extradimensional Envanz]] - Envanz's high Curse uptime and decent Slow can help to stall Oldstrich.
*[[Izanami of Dusk (Legend Rare Cat)|Izanami of Eventide]] - Izanami's high piercing range helps significantly when sniping Wahwah and can also deal with incoming Dogensteins extremely easily. Her [[Conjure]] can also help to stall Oldstrich when needed.

